  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-06-06T12:49:45-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 6, 2017, 12:49 pm\">June 6, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet The Artist, <a href=\"/artists/doris-mee/\">Doris Mee</a>, Saturday, June 17 from 2 to 4 PM at<a title=\"Original source page returned 404\" href> The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (source page unavailable)</span>, 551 Route 28, Harwich Port.</p>\n<p>Doris will create a “Cape Cod Beach Houses” scene, using her unique mixed media/collage method for creating this type of painting. She uses a wide variety of papers, which she hand-paints in watercolor or acrylic in preparation for assembling her collage. Several new paintings will be displayed.</p>\n<p>Free public parking is available directly across the street at the Harwich Chamber of Commerce Visitor Center.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-24848e4ea0af8641d360/\" rel=\"tag\">EDUCATION</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\" rel=\"tag\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-6e9041272e0af8b4ebb7/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-4d8a37313a19a46a9741/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod Art Galleries</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-ca2a1c0bde236338a43a/\" rel=\"tag\">Doris Mee</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-c5a0664c0f5b2d29d271/\" rel=\"tag\">Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-6f56c969f1b38f37fb88/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich MA</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-95692369e68e1fd966d5/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich Port</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-a78c41d2215f142284bf/\" rel=\"tag\">The Warm Side of the Cape</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
